+# Lab orders
+
+Contents: 1. Rules on an order as validators
+
+## 1. Rules on an order as validators
+
+Check each rule on a lab order in 1 class whose name is the rule followed by Validator, such as PanelValidator. Where the rule needs a value that the order misses, that same class also corrects the order before it checks it, such as filling in a missing time with the time of the order, and returns the corrected order; never put the correction in another class. The lab team finds every rule on an order, and every correction that the rule makes, by the word Validator.
