+  - "src/main/java/**/web/**/*.java"
+---
+# Web
+
+Contents: 1. Types of a call named for their resource
+
+## 1. Types of a call named for their resource
+
+End the name of each type that a controller takes or returns in Body, after the name of the resource it carries, such as AppointmentBody for an appointment that the controller returns and NewAppointmentBody for one that it takes. The front end of the clinic edits each resource as 1 form, and the word Body tells a reader of the front end and of the back end that the type is the form of that resource.
